<html>
  <head>
    <title>
      PersonFact - Person Facts.
    </title>
    <meta charSet="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="css/main.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="css/devices.css">
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="header">
      <div class="container-lrg">
        <div class="col-12 spread">
          <div>
            <a class="logo">
              PersonFacts (fedora)
            </a>
          </div>
          <div>
            <a class="nav-link" href="#">
              Twitter
            </a>
            <a class="nav-link" href="#">
              Facebook
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="container-lrg flex">
        <div class="col-6 centervertical">
          <h1 class="heading">
            Instantly search people.
          </h1>
          <h2 class="paragraph ">
            We're creating the best place to go when starting a new business or company. With PersonFacts you can instantly search people and see facts.
          </h2>
          <div class="ctas">
            <input class="ctas-input" type="text" placeholder="Your Email Address">
            <button class="ctas-button">
              Sign Up
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-6 sidedevices">
          <div class="iphoneipad">
            <div class="iphone">
              <div class="mask">
                <img class="mask-img" src="img/mobileapp.svg">
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ipad">
              <div class="mask">
                <img class="mask-img" src="img/webapp.svg">
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="feature5">
      <div class="container-sml text-center">
        <div class="col-12">
          <h3 class="heading">
            The Best Person Facts.
          </h3>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="container-lrg flex">
        <div class="col-5 centervertical">
          <div class="steps">
            <div class="emoji">
              <b>
                🎓
              </b>
            </div>
            <h3 class="subheading">
              Smart
            </h3>
            <p class="paragraph">
              PersonFacts instantly shows you the best person facts. Followed by hundreds of new companies. Get your person facts today!
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="steps">
            <div class="emoji">
              <b>
                💐
              </b>
            </div>
            <h3 class="subheading">
              Gorgeous
            </h3>
            <p class="paragraph">
              Searching people has never been soooo easy! With PersonFacts you can instantly search for twitter, facebook, medium, and instagram handles.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="steps">
            <div class="emoji">
              <b>
                🚀
              </b>
            </div>
            <h3 class="subheading">
              Insanely Fast
            </h3>
            <p class="paragraph">
              We've hand travelled the depths of the internet to bring you gorgeous facts. The best facts. &nbsp;Featuring the beautiful facts of people.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-1">
        </div>
        <div class="col-6">
          <div class="sidedevices">
            <div class="iphoneipad2">
              <div class="iphone">
                <div class="mask">
                  <img class="mask-img" src="img/mobileapp.svg">
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="ipad">
                <div class="mask">
                  <img class="mask-img" src="img/webapp.svg">
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="socialproof">
      <div class="container-lrg">
        <div class="flex">
          <div class="col-6">
            <h4 class="subheading">
              "What a time saver for startup founders...this can be one of the most awful and creative sinkholes that a team goes through... Bravo for making this hellish process a little better."
            </h4>
            <p class="paragraph">
              Gregory Deepwood - President @ DeepWoods
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 logos flex">
            <img class="col-4" src="img/techcrunch.svg">
            <img class="col-4" src="img/google.svg">
            <img class="col-4" src="img/citibank.svg">
            <img class="col-4" src="img/softbank.svg">
            <img class="col-4" src="img/dribble.svg">
            <img class="col-4" src="img/bloomberg.svg">
            <img class="col-4" src="img/facebook.svg">
            <img class="col-4" src="img/applewatch.svg">
            <img class="col-4" src="img/amazon.svg">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <div class="container-sml flex text-center">
        <div class="col-12">
          <h3 class="heading">
            Instantly search&nbsp;<div>People Facts</div>
          </h3>
          <div class="ctas">
            <a class="ctas-button" href="">
              Sign Up
            </a>
            <a class="ctas-button-2" href="">
              Sign Up
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="container-lrg footer-nav flex">
        <div class="col-3 vertical">
          <a class="logo">
            PersonFacts
          </a>
          <a class="nav-link2">
            ©2017 Liam Randall
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="col-3 vertical">
          <a class="nav-link2">
            About
          </a>
          <a class="nav-link2">
            Features
          </a>
          <a class="nav-link2">
            Pricing
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="col-3 vertical">
          <a class="nav-link2">
            Twitter
          </a>
          <a class="nav-link2">
            Facebook
          </a>
          <a class="nav-link2">
            Contact
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="col-3 vertical">
          <a class="nav-link2">
            123 People Fact #708, 90210, California, United States of America
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
